Synchronize wallet and contracts with the blockchain

Usage: rgb-patched sync [OPTIONS] [WALLET]

Arguments:
  [WALLET]  Wallet to use [env: RGB_WALLET=]

Options:
  -d, --data-dir <DATA_DIR>
          Location of the data directory [env: RGB_DATA_DIR=] [default: <host_default_rgb_dir>]
      --electrum[=<URL>]
          Electrum server to use [env: ELECRTUM_SERVER=]
      --esplora[=<URL>]
          Esplora server to use [env: ESPLORA_SERVER=]
  -n, --network <NETWORK>
          Bitcoin network [env: RGB_NETWORK=] [default: testnet4]
      --no-network-prefix
          Do not add network name as a prefix to the data directory [env: RGB_NO_NETWORK_PREFIX=]
      --min-confirmations <MIN_CONFIRMATIONS>
          Minimal number of confirmations to consider an operation final [default: 32]
  -h, --help
          Print help
